window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><i>Live-in tutor wanted for four-year-old. Must be willing to relocate to a remote mountain estate. $3K/week cash.</i></p> <p>On the run from ruthless killers, I’m down to 10 bucks in my wallet and a half-tank of gas in my ancient car when I spot the ad. The job sounds like the answer to my prayers, but there’s a catch. </p> <p>The child’s father is the most beautiful, most dangerous man I’ve ever met.</p> <p>Darkly seductive and filthy rich, Nikolai Molotov is a tantalizing mystery, a lethally alluring contradiction. Bruised knuckles and tailored suits, tender endearments and dirty promises - my new employer draws me in like a magnet, even as my instincts scream for me to run. </p> <p>I should’ve heeded them...because I’m not the only one with secrets. </p> <p>My safe haven just might be the devil’s lair, and once he’s claimed me, it will be too late to run.</p>"; 
